    <string name="takeover_explanation">New files these apps save to your gallery/downloads are moved into PJM (the app\'s private storage): saved into the vault first, then the original on the phone is deleted. Only files saved after you add an app are handled; existing gallery content is left alone. If deleting an original fails, a notification lets you retry.</string>
